<title>FRANCE: TABLE-FRENCH FARM MINISTRY GRAIN/OILSEED ESTIMATES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-FRENCH FARM MINISTRY GRAIN/OILSEED ESTIMATES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>This is a breakdown of French agriculture ministry supply projections, effective August 1.</p>
<p>Please note the figures are all as published by the ministry except for the average 1997 yields for Total Grain (6.75 tonnes per hectare) and Total Oilseeds (2.88 tonnes). These were</p>
<p>supplied separately by ministry officials after Tuesday's</p>
<p>published version included two typographical errors.</p>
<p>(Area: '000 ha. Yield: tonnes/hectare. Production: '000 tonnes)</p>
